sort [l_returnflag asc, l_linestatus asc]
└─ project (l_returnflag, l_linestatus, sum_qty, sum_base_price, sum_disc_price, sum_charge, avg_qty, avg_price, avg_disc, count_order) (rows≈6 cost≈3.9K)
   └─ aggregate keys=[lineitem.l_returnflag, lineitem.l_linestatus] aggs=[sum_0=sum, sum_1=sum, sum_2=sum, sum_3=sum, sum_4=sum, count_0=count, sum_5=sum, count_1=count, sum_6=sum, count_2=count, count_3=count] (rows≈6 cost≈3.3K)
      └─ project (lineitem.l_returnflag, lineitem.l_linestatus, lineitem.l_quantity, lineitem.l_extendedprice, arg_0, arg_1, lineitem.l_discount) (rows≈10 cost≈2.1K)
         └─ filter (<= |lineitem.l_shipdate| (- (: 10561 i32) (: 81 i32))) (rows≈10 cost≈1.4K)
